# Archivist WebUI Environment Configuration

# REST API endpoint for the archivist-node sidecar
# Default: http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/archivist/v1
# Set this to point to your running archivist-node instance
VITE_API_URL=/api/archivist/v1

# For remote deployments, use:
# For production, expose the node through the same web origin or a secure API gateway.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api/archivist/v1
